return ['domain'=>'zinn-translate','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);','language'=>'ha','project-id-version'=>'zinn-translate','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-10-02T10:29:43+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-10-02T10:29:43+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Zinn® Translate'=>'Zinn® Translate','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-translate'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-translate','Publishes this site in every language you choose, on its own web addresses, with translated slugs, metadata, menus, WooCommerce products, hreflang, per-language sitemaps and llms.txt. Translate with your Zinn Digital® plan or with your own provider key.'=>'Yana buga wannan rukunin yanar gizon a kowane harshe da kuka zaɓa, a kan adiresoshin yanar gizonsa na kansa, tare da fassara slugs, bayanan metadata, menu, kayayyakin WooCommerce, hreflang, taswirorin rukunin yanar gizo na kowane harshe da kuma llms.txt. Yi fassara da tsarin Zinn Digital® ɗinku ko da maɓallin mai ba da sabis na kanku.','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','Stored. Type a new value to replace it.'=>'An ajiye. Rubuta sabuwar ƙima domin maye gurbinta.','Filter this list…'=>'Tace wannan jeri…','Filter this list'=>'Tace wannan jeri','Nothing matches that filter.'=>'Babu abin da ya dace da wannan tace.','Add a row'=>'Ƙara layi','Remove this row'=>'Cire wannan layin','Remove'=>'Cire','Zinn Digital®'=>'Zinn Digital®','Zinn Digital® — overview'=>'Zinn Digital® — taƙaitaccen bayani','Overview'=>'Taƙaitaccen bayani','Copied'=>'An kwafa','Every Zinn® plugin on this site, and whether it is working.'=>'Kowane manhajar Zinn® a kan wannan rukunin yanar gizon, da kuma ko yana aiki.','No connection is needed for this plugin.'=>'Ba a buƙatar haɗin intanet don wannan manhajar ba.','Open settings'=>'Bude saituna','You do not have permission to change these settings.'=>'Ba ku da izinin canza waɗannan saitunan.','Settings sections'=>'Sassan saituna','Support'=>'Taimako','Save changes'=>'Ajiye canje-canje','Tools'=>'Kayan aiki','Export settings'=>'Fitar da saituna','Reset to defaults'=>'Sake saita zuwa asali','This puts every setting on this plugin back to its default. Continue?'=>'Wannan zai mayar da kowane saiti na wannan plugin zuwa na asali. A ci gaba?','Diagnostics for support'=>'Binciken matsala don taimako','Import a settings file'=>'Shigo da fayil ɗin saituna','Import'=>'Shigo da','Exported files never contain passwords, tokens or API keys — you will need to enter those again on the new site.'=>'Fayilolin da aka fitar ba sa taɓa ƙunsar kalmomin sirri, alamu ko maɓallan API — za ku buƙaci sake shigar da su a sabon rukunin yanar gizon.','Settings saved.'=>'An ajiye saituna.','Every setting on this plugin is back to its default.'=>'Kowane saiti a kan wannan manhaja ta plugin ya koma asali.','Done.'=>'An gama.','That action is not available.'=>'Wannan aikin ba ya samuwa.','That file could not be read. Choose a settings file exported from a Zinn® plugin.'=>'Ba a iya karanta wannan fayil ɗin ba. Zaɓi fayil ɗin saituna da aka fitar daga manhajar Zinn®.','That file is too large to be a settings export.'=>'Wannan fayil ɗin ya yi girma da yawa da zai zama fitarwar saiti.','That file is not a Zinn® settings export.'=>'Wannan fayil ɗin ba fitarwar saitunan Zinn® ba ne.','That file was exported from a different plugin (%s), so importing it here would store settings this plugin does not understand.'=>'An fitar da wannan fayil ɗin daga wani daban na toshe (%s), don haka shigar da shi a nan zai adana saitunan da wannan toshe ba ya fahimta.','%d setting imported. Passwords and API keys are never in an export, so enter those again.'=>'An shigo da saitin %d. Ba a taɓa haɗa kalmomin sirri da maƙallan API a cikin fitarwa ba, don haka sake shigar da su.' . "\0" . 'An shigo da saituna %d. Ba a taɓa haɗa kalmomin sirri da maɓallan API a cikin fitarwa ba, don haka sake shigar da su.','Translate'=>'Fassara','Manual overrides'=>'Sauye-sauye da hannu','Sitemaps and URLs'=>'Taswirorin shafi da URLs','General'=>'Gaba ɗaya','Who pays for the translation'=>'Waye ke biyan kudin fassarar','Either your Zinn Digital® plan, or an API key of your own. There is no free tier — somebody pays a provider for every word.'=>'Ko dai shirin Zinn Digital® dinka, ko kuma maɓallin API naka na kanka. Babu matakin kyauta — wani yana biyan mai ba da sabis don kowace kalma.','My Zinn Digital® plan'=>'Tsarina na Zinn Digital®','My own provider key'=>'Makullin mai bada sabis nawa','Site ID'=>'ID na Shafin','From your Zinn Digital® dashboard, on this site\'s Translation tab.'=>'Daga allon sarrafawa na Zinn Digital® ɗinku, a kan shafin Translation na wannan shafin.','Site token'=>'Alamar shafi','An API key from your Zinn Digital® dashboard, on its API keys page. Give it the sites.view and sites.translation.manage permissions.'=>'Makullin API daga allon sarrafawa na Zinn Digital® naka, a shafin makullan API dinsa. Bashi izinin sites.view da na sites.translation.manage.','Provider'=>'Mai bada sabis','API key'=>'Makullin API','Your key, billed to you by the provider. It is stored on this site and sent only to them.'=>'Mabuɗinku, wanda mai ba da sabis ɗin ya caje ku. Ana adana shi a wannan rukunin yanar gizon kuma ana aika shi zuwa gare su kawai.','Model'=>'Samfuri','Leave empty for the cheapest model that does the job well.'=>'Bar shi a wofi domin samfur mafi sauƙin kuɗi wanda yake gudanar da aikin yadda ya kamata.','This site is written in'=>'An rubuta wannan rukunin yanar gizo a','Leave empty to use the site language from WordPress settings.'=>'Bar shi a wofi don amfani da yaren shafi daga saitunan WordPress.','Languages to publish'=>'Harsunan da za a wallafa','Each one gets its own web addresses and its own sitemap. Publish only the languages you want indexed.'=>'Kowannensu yana samun nasa adiresoshin intanet da nasa taswirar shafi. Buga kawai yarukan da kake son a tsara su.','Translate automatically when I publish or update'=>'Fassara ta atomatik lokacin da na buga ko na sabunta','Editing a page marks its translations out of date and they are remade in the background. Editing without changing any words costs nothing.'=>'Gyara shafi yana sanya fassarorinsa su zama tsofaffi kuma ana sake yin su a bango. Gyarawa ba tare da canza kowace kalma ba ba ya ci kowane abu.','What gets translated'=>'Abin da ake fassarawa','Post types'=>'Nau\'ikan rubutu','Translate the web addresses too'=>'Fassara adiresoshin yanar gizo ma','French visitors get /fr/a-propos/ rather than /fr/about/. The untranslated address keeps working and redirects, so nothing that was indexed breaks.'=>'Masu ziyara na Faransanci suna samun /fr/a-propos/ maimakon /fr/about/. Adireshin da ba a fassara ba yana ci gaba da aiki kuma yana karkatarwa, saboda haka babu abin da aka jera wanda zai lalace.','Translate SEO titles, descriptions and image alt text'=>'Fassara kanun labaran SEO, bayanai da rubutun alt na hoto','Translate categories and tags'=>'Fassara rukunoni da alamomi','Translate navigation menus'=>'Fassara menus na kewayawa','Translate WooCommerce products and attributes'=>'Fassara kayayyaki da siffofin WooCommerce','Short descriptions, purchase notes, attribute labels and variation descriptions. Prices, SKUs and stored option values are never touched.'=>'Gajerun bayanai, bayanan kula na saye, alamomin sifa da bayanan bambance-bambance. Farashi, SKUs da adana ƙimar zaɓuɓɓuka ba a taɓa shafan su ba.','SEO'=>'SEO','Add hreflang tags'=>'Ƙara alamomin hreflang','Tells search engines these pages are the same page in different languages. Leave this on unless another plugin is already doing it.'=>'Yana sanar da injunan bincike cewa waɗannan shafuka shafi ɗaya ne a cikin yaruka daban-daban. Bar wannan a kunne sai dai idan wani manhaja (plugin) na daban yana yin hakan a yanzu.','Publish a sitemap for each language'=>'Buga taswirar shafi ga kowane yare','Publish llms.txt for each language'=>'Buga llms.txt don kowane yare','A plain-text map of the site that AI answer engines read. They often cannot run JavaScript and may never fetch a sitemap.'=>'Taswirar shafin a rubutu zalla wadda injinan amsa na AI ke karantawa. Sau da yawa ba sa iya gudanar da JavaScript kuma suna iya rashin ɗauko taswirar shafi har abada.','Language switcher'=>'Mai sauya harshe','Style'=>'Salo','Colours, spacing and corners are on the Styling tab. Place it with the block, the [zinn_language_switcher] shortcode, or a menu.'=>'Launuka, tazarar rubutu da kusurwoyi suna kan shafin Styling. Saka shi tare da bulo, gajeriyar lambar [zinn_language_switcher], ko menu.','Show only these languages'=>'Nuna waɗannan yaruka kawai','Leave empty to show every language you publish.'=>'Bar shi a wofi don nuna kowane yare da kake wallafawa.','Name each language in its own language'=>'Sanya sunan kowane harshe a cikin harshensa','Deutsch rather than German. Somebody who cannot read the current page cannot read "German" either.'=>'Deutsch maimakon German. Mutumin da ba zai iya karanta wannan shafi na yanzu ba ba zai iya karanta "German" ba kuma.','Show flags'=>'Nuna tutoci','Off by default: a language is not a country, and Arabic and Spanish have no single flag that does not exclude most of their speakers.'=>'A kashe a matsayin asali: yare ba ƙasa ba ne, kuma Larabci da Sifaniyanci ba su da tuta guda ɗaya wadda ba za ta ware yawancin masu magana da su ba.','Include the language being read'=>'Haɗa yaren da ake karantawa','Include the original language'=>'Haɗa ainihin yaren','Add it to this menu'=>'Ƙara shi a wannan menu','Only the menu you name here. Nothing is added to any other menu on the site.'=>'Kawai menu ɗin da kuka saka sunansa a nan. Babu abin da za a ƙara a kowane menu a shafin.','Accent'=>'Karin sauti','Background'=>'Bayan fage','Text'=>'Rubutu','Corner radius'=>'Ganin kwana','Spacing'=>'Tazara','Text size'=>'Girmar rubutu','Do not add it to a menu'=>'Kada a ƙara shi zuwa menu','none'=>'babu','On a Zinn Digital® plan you choose the languages to publish on this site\'s Translation tab in your dashboard, under "Shown to visitors". This site checks it every hour. Publishing now: %s.'=>'A kan tsarin Zinn Digital®, kuna zaɓar yarukan da za a buga a shafin Fassara na wannan rukunin yanar gizo a cikin allon sarrafawarku, a ƙarƙashin "Shown to visitors". Wannan rukunin yanar gizo yana duba shi a kowane sa\'a. Ana bugawa yanzu: %s.','On a Zinn Digital® plan you choose the languages to publish on this site\'s Translation tab in your dashboard. This site has not read that choice yet, so it is still publishing: %s. Check the Site ID and token above.'=>'A kan tsarin Zinn Digital® kuna zaɓar yarukan da za a buga a shafin Fassara na wannan rukunin yanar gizon a cikin allon sarrafawarku. Wannan rukunin yanar gizon bai karanta wannan zaɓin ba tukuna, don haka har yanzu yana buga: %s. Duba ID ɗin Rukunin Yanar Gizo da alamar izini da ke sama.','Edit any translation here. An edited translation is kept exactly as you wrote it and is never overwritten when the page is translated again.'=>'Gyara kowace fassara a nan. Fassara da aka gyara ana ajiye ta daidai yadda kuka rubuta ta kuma ba za a taɓa sake rubuta wani abu a kanta ba idan aka sake fassara shafin.','Every language'=>'Duk harsuna','Search translations'=>'Bincika fassarori','Filter'=>'Tace','Content'=>'Abun ciki','Language'=>'Harshe','Translation'=>'Fassara','Status'=>'Matsayi','Save'=>'Ajiye','Nothing translated yet. Publish a language and translation starts in the background.'=>'Ba a fassara komai ba tukuna. Buga wani harshe kuma za a fara fassarar a bango.','These addresses are live. Open any of them to check it, and submit the sitemap index to Google Search Console.'=>'Wadannan adiresoshin suna aiki. Bude kowane ɗayansu don bincika shi, sannan ka tura jigon taswirar shafin zuwa Google Search Console.','You are not allowed to edit translations on this site.'=>'Ba a ba ku izinin gyara fassarori a wannan rukunin yanar gizon ba.','Edited by you — kept'=>'Kai ne ka gyara — an ajiye','Source changed — will be redone'=>'Tushe ya canza — za a sake yi','Up to date'=>'Na zamani','Connected'=>'An haɗa','Connecting…'=>'Ana haɗawa…','Connected, but something needs attention'=>'An haɗa, amma akwai abin da ke buƙatar kulawa','Not connected'=>'Ba a haɗa ba','Running on your own account'=>'Yana aiki a kan asusunka','We could not check this'=>'Ba mu iya bincika wannan ba','This plugin did not say why. Send a diagnostics report and we will look.'=>'Wannan plugin din bai bayyana dalili ba. Aika rahoton binciken matsala kuma za mu duba.','Connection status'=>'Matsayin haɗin yanar gizo','Last checked %s ago.'=>'An duba na ƙarshe %s da suka wuce.','(opens in a new tab)'=>'(yana buɗewa a sabon shafin)','Send this to Zinn® support'=>'Aika wannan ga sashen tallafi na Zinn®','This is exactly what will be sent — nothing else, and nothing hidden. Your passwords, tokens and API keys are not in it.'=>'Wannan shi ne ainihin abin da za a aika — ba wani abu dabam, kuma babu wani abu a ɓoye. Kalmomin sirrinku, tokens da maɓallan API ɗinku ba sa ciki.','The diagnostics report that will be sent'=>'Rahoton gwajin da za a aika','Copy to clipboard'=>'Kwafa zuwa allon kwafi','Send this report to Zinn® support'=>'Aika wannan rahoton zuwa ga tallafin Zinn®','We open a support ticket for you and reply by email. If you would rather not send it, copy it above and paste it into a ticket yourself.'=>'Muna buɗe muku tikitin taimako kuma mu ba da amsa ta imel. Idan ba kwa son aikawa, kwafi shi a sama sannan ku liƙa shi da kanku a cikin tikiti.','We could not reach Zinn Digital® from this server (%s). Copy the report above and open a ticket instead — nothing about your settings is wrong.'=>'Ba mu iya isa ga Zinn Digital® daga wannan sabar (%s) ba. Kwafi rahoton da ke sama sannan ka buɗe tikiti a maimakon haka — babu wani abu da ba daidai ba game da saitunanku.','Sent. Zinn® support has your report and will reply by email.'=>'An aika. Sashen tallafi na Zinn® ya karɓi rahotonka kuma zai ba da amsa ta imel.','Sent. Zinn® support has your report — reference %s — and will reply by email.'=>'An aika. Tallafin Zinn® ya karɓi rahotonku — lamba ta musamman %s — kuma zai ba da amsa ta imel.','You have sent several reports in a short time. Wait a few minutes and try again — the earlier ones did arrive.'=>'Kun aika rahotanni da yawa a cikin kankanin lokaci. Jira na \'yan mintuna ka sake gwadawa — na farkon sun iso.','Zinn Digital® could not accept the report just now — that is our end, not yours. Try again shortly, or copy the report above into a ticket.'=>'Zinn Digital® ba zai iya karɓar rahoton ba a yanzu — matsalar daga ɓangarenmu take, ba daga naku ba. Sake gwadawa an jima kaɗan, ko kuma ku kwafi rahoton da ke sama zuwa tikiti.','The report was refused (HTTP %d). Copy it above and open a ticket, quoting that number.'=>'An ƙi karɓar rahoton (HTTP %d). Kwafi shi a sama sannan ka buɗe tikiti, kana ambaton wannan lambar.','%s — guides and services'=>'%s — jagorori da ayyuka','User guides'=>'Jagororin mai amfani','Read the %s user guide'=>'Karanta jagorar mai amfani da %s','Hide this'=>'Ɓoye wannan','Zinn® hosting for WordPress'=>'Bakuncin Zinn® don WordPress','LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site.'=>'LiteSpeed, ajiyar bayanan yau da kullum, sauya wurin aiki kyauta da allon sarrafawa da aka gina domin mutanen da ke gudanar da shafuka fiye da daya.','The Zinn® marketplace'=>'Kasuwar Zinn®','Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy.'=>'Sayi kuma sayar da kafaffun shafukan yanar gizo, yankuna (domains) da wuraren sanya hanyoyin haɗi (links), tare da ajiye kuɗin cikin aminci har sai ɓangarorin biyu sun gamsu.','Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living'=>'Zinn Hub® — ɗauki ma\'aikatan da wannan shi ne sana\'arsu','Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid.'=>'Kasuwar mu ta duniya ta masu aikin kashin kai: bincika sama da ayyuka 10,000 da aka shirya daga marubuta, masu ƙira, masu haɓaka software da ƙwararrun SEO, ko buga aiki kuma ka bar su su yi takara.','The API key was rejected. Check that it is still valid and has translation access, then save it again.'=>'An ƙi karɓar maɓallin API ɗin. Bincika ko har yanzu yana aiki kuma yana da damar fassara, sannan ku sake ajiye shi.','The provider refused on billing or quota. Nothing was translated. Check the balance and limits on your account with them.'=>'Mai ba da sabis ɗin ya ƙi saboda biyan kuɗi ko ƙa\'idar iyaka. Ba a fassara komai ba. Bincika ma\'auni da iyakokin asusunka tare da su.','The translation provider is having a problem at their end. Nothing was translated or charged, and it will try again on the next pass.'=>'Mai ba da sabis na fassara yana fuskantar matsala daga ɓangarensa. Ba a fassara komai ba kuma ba a caje komai ba, kuma za a sake gwadawa a zango na gaba.','The translation request failed and we could not tell why. Nothing was saved.'=>'Neman fassarar ya faskara kuma ba mu iya gano dalili ba. Ba a adana komai ba.','Sitemap index'=>'Fihirisar taswirar shafi','%s sitemap'=>'Taswirar shafi ta %s','LLM content map'=>'Taswirar abun ciki na LLM','%s LLM content map'=>'Taswirar abun ciki na LLM na %s','Languages published'=>'Harsunan da aka buga','Site language'=>'Harshen shafi','SEO plugin'=>'Kayan aikin SEO','No translation provider is set up yet.'=>'Ba a saita mai ba da fassara ba tukuna.','Paste an API key from your chosen provider, or connect the site to a Zinn Digital® account, and translation starts on the next pass.'=>'Manna maɓallin API daga mai ba da sabis ɗin da kuka zaɓa, ko haɗa shafin da asusun Zinn Digital®, kuma fassarar za ta fara a mataki na gaba.','Translating with your own %s key.'=>'Fassara ta amfani da maɓallin %s na kanku.','This site is not connected to a Zinn Digital® account, which is fine — your provider bills you directly.'=>'Wannan rukunin yanar gizon ba a haɗa shi da asusun Zinn Digital® ba, wanda babu matsala — mai ba ku sabis yana cajin ku kai tsaye.','Not connected to Zinn Digital® yet.'=>'Ba a haɗa da Zinn Digital® ba tukuna.','Add this site\'s ID and token from your Zinn Digital® dashboard, or switch to your own provider key to run without an account.'=>'Ƙara ID da alamar wannan rukunin yanar gizo daga allon sarrafawa na Zinn Digital® ɗinku, ko canza zuwa maɓallin mai ba da sabis na kanku don aiki ba tare da asusu ba.','Connected to Zinn Digital®.'=>'An haɗa da Zinn Digital®.','The translation provider is having a problem.'=>'Mai ba da sabis na fassara yana fuskantar matsala.','Translation is paused — your provider needs attention.'=>'An dakatar da fassarar — mai ba da sabis ɗinku yana buƙatar kulawa.','Translation has not been set up yet.'=>'Ba a saita fassara ba tukuna.','Something went wrong at our end.'=>'Wani abu ya sami matsala daga ɓangarenmu.','Check their status page'=>'Duba shafinsu na matsayi','Fix this on your account'=>'Gyara wannan a asusunka','Style preset'=>'Saitin salon da aka riga aka saita','A starting point. Anything below overrides it.'=>'Matsayin farawa. Duk wani abu a ƙasa yana maye gurbinsa.','Use my own colours and sizes'=>'Yi amfani da launuka da girmana na kaina','Leave this off and the preset is used exactly as it is.'=>'Bar wannan a kashe kuma za a yi amfani da saitin daidai yadda yake.','Zinn® language switcher'=>'Mai sauya harshe na Zinn®','Let visitors read this page in another language.'=>'Bada damar maziyarta su karanta wannan shafi a wani yaren daban.','Title'=>'Take','Use the plugin setting'=>'Yi amfani da saitin manhaja','Dropdown'=>'Zaɓin da ke zubowa','Inline list'=>'Jerin cikin layi','Pills'=>'Kwayoyi','Minimal text'=>'Kadan rubutu','Flags and names'=>'Tuta da sunaye','Stacked list'=>'Jerin da aka tara','Choose a language'=>'Zaɓi harshe','See the Zinn Digital® release notes.'=>'Duba bayanan sakin Zinn Digital®.','The Zinn® update service did not issue a download link for this update. Check that this site can reach the Zinn® platform, then try again.'=>'Sabis ɗin sabuntawa na Zinn® bai bayar da hanyar saukewa don wannan sabuntawa ba. Bincika cewa wannan rukunin yanar gizon zai iya samun damar shiga dandamalin Zinn®, sannan sake gwadawa.','The update could not be downloaded from the Zinn® update service (%s). Try again in a few minutes.'=>'Ba a iya sauke sabuntawar ba daga sabis ɗin sabuntawa na Zinn® (%s). Sake gwadawa nan da \'yan mintoci.','The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed.'=>'Ɗaukakawar da aka saukar ta kasa cin jarrabawar sahihanci kuma ba a girka ta ba.','No DeepL API key is saved, so there is nothing to translate with.'=>'Ba a ajiye makullin API na DeepL ba, don haka babu abin da za a yi fassara da shi.','DeepL does not translate into %s. Choose Google Gemini or OpenAI for this language, or connect the site to Zinn Digital®.'=>'DeepL ba ya fassarawa zuwa %s. Zabi Google Gemini ko OpenAI don wannan yaren, ko haɗa shafin da Zinn Digital®.','DeepL could not be reached. Nothing was translated and nothing was charged; it will try again on the next pass.'=>'Ba a iya samun DeepL ba. Ba a fassara komai ba kuma ba a caji komai ba; za a sake gwadawa a zagaye na gaba.','Your DeepL character quota is used up for this period. Translation resumes when it resets, or when you raise the limit on your DeepL account.'=>'Kason haruffan ku na DeepL ya ƙare na wannan lokacin. Fassarar za ta ci gaba idan an sake saita shi, ko kuma idan kun ƙara iyakar a asusun ku na DeepL.','DeepL answered with something we could not read. Nothing was saved.'=>'DeepL ya amsa da wani abu da ba mu iya karantawa ba. Ba a ajiye komai ba.','No Google Gemini API key is saved, so there is nothing to translate with.'=>'Ba a ajiye maɓallin Google Gemini API ba, don haka babu abin da za a fassara da shi.','Google Gemini could not be reached. Nothing was translated and nothing was charged; it will try again on the next pass.'=>'Ba a iya samun Google Gemini ba. Ba a fassara komai ba kuma ba a caji komai ba; zai sake gwadawa a zubi na gaba.','No OpenAI API key is saved, so there is nothing to translate with.'=>'Ba a ajiye mabuɗin OpenAI API ba, don haka babu abin da za a yi fassara da shi.','OpenAI could not be reached. Nothing was translated and nothing was charged; it will try again on the next pass.'=>'Ba a iya samun OpenAI ba. Ba a fassara komai ba kuma ba a caji komai ba; za a sake gwadawa a zango na gaba.','This site is not connected to Zinn Digital®, so there is nothing to collect. Add the Site ID and token, or switch to your own provider key.'=>'Wannan rukunin yanar gizon ba ya haɗe da Zinn Digital®, saboda haka babu abin da za a tattara. Ƙara ID na rukunin yanar gizo da alama (token), ko canza zuwa maɓallin mai ba da sabis na kanku.','This site is not connected to Zinn Digital®.'=>'Wannan rukunin yanar gizon ba shi da alaƙa da Zinn Digital®.','Zinn Digital® could not be reached. Nothing was sent; it will try again on the next pass.'=>'Ba a iya samun Zinn Digital® ba. Ba a aika komai ba; za a sake gwadawa a zagaye na gaba.','Translation is paused on this site. Check the account is up to date on your Zinn Digital® dashboard.'=>'An dakatar da fassara a wannan shafin. Bincika ko asusun na da sabon bayani a kan allon sarrafawa na Zinn Digital® dinku.','Zinn Digital® rejected this site\'s token. It must be an API key with the sites.view and sites.translation.manage permissions — create one on the API keys page of your dashboard.'=>'Zinn Digital® ya ki amincewa da alamar (token) wannan shafin. Dole ne ya zama mabuɗin API tare da izinin sites.view da sites.translation.manage — ƙirƙiri ɗaya a shafin mabuɗan API na allon sarrafawarka.','Zinn Digital® could not be reached. Your site keeps serving the translations it already has.'=>'Ba a iya samun Zinn Digital® ba. Shafinku yana ci gaba da ba da fassarorin da yake da su a yanzu.','Zinn Digital® answered with something we could not read. Your site keeps serving the translations it already has.'=>'Zinn Digital® ya ba da amsa da wani abu da ba mu iya karantawa ba. Shafinku yana ci gaba da ba da fassarorin da yake da su a dā.','Zinn Digital® could not be reached. Your site keeps publishing the languages it already has.'=>'Ba a iya samun Zinn Digital® ba. Shafinku yana ci gaba da buga harsunan da yake da su a yanzu.','Zinn Digital® answered with something we could not read. Your site keeps publishing the languages it already has.'=>'Zinn Digital® ya ba da amsa da wani abu da ba mu iya karantawa ba. Shafinku yana ci gaba da buga harsunan da yake da su a yanzu.']];